# Ignore package-lock.json in favour of npm-shrinkwrap.json for npm publishing
package-lock.json*

# Native C++ build output — TEMPORARILY committed during active dev (see native/win-x64/,
# native/win-x86/) so it can be pulled directly instead of hand-delivered each iteration. Re-add
# `native/` here (and git-rm the tracked binaries) once this round of native-side work settles —
# see NEXT_STEPS.md.

# MSBuild's default IntDir nests under a project-name subfolder, same layout quirk as
# appium-desktop-driver's dotnet-bridge-agent/ — see native-uia-bridge/build.bat.
native-uia-bridge/UiaBridge/
native-uia-bridge/Injector/
native-uia-bridge/x64/
native-uia-bridge/Debug/
native-uia-bridge/Release/
native-uia-bridge/*.vcxproj.user
